# Pillow, which compares the pictures of the screenshot bot by their pixels: a
# picture whose pixels stayed the same keeps its committed file. It has no
# dependencies, and the hashes of all its wheels make the lock file hold for every
# Python and system of a runner. Renovate compiles it again with the command in the
# header of requirements.txt.
# https://github.com/Dennis-Otto/repo-blueprint
